  DisplayName: Academy Dropout
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You were enrolled at a prestigious magical academy, but you've since
    dropped out. Maybe there was a momentous incident, maybe you had to return to
    other responsibilities, or perhaps it was just too much for you. Whatever the
    case, your exit from the academy has shaped your life as much as your entrance
    and led you to a life of adventure. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in Arcana and Academia Lore. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dubious
    Knowledge] skill feat.
